@orders = http://localhost:5210

### 1. Create order for existing client (exp. 201 + Loc)
POST {{orders}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 1,
  "description": "Книга «Кобзар»",
  "amount": 250
}

### 2. Get order by id (exp. 200)
GET {{orders}}/api/orders/1

### 3. Create order for non-existent client (exp. 400 problem+json)
POST {{orders}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 9999,
  "description": "Тест",
  "amount": 100
}

### 4. Validation error (exp. 400 problem+json)
POST {{orders}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 1,
  "description": "",
  "amount": -5
}

### 5. Get non-existent order (exp. 404 problem+json)
GET {{orders}}/api/orders/9999